<section class="section section--hero">
  <div class="content stack">
    <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
    <h1 class="display">It began with a bell every <em>half hour</em>.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Our founder went to school in Europe, where the bells kept the day. She came home to towers that had gone quiet.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--page">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--story">
    <div class="stack prose">
      <figure class="quote">
        <blockquote>When I went to school in Europe, I loved hearing church bells ringing every 1/2 hour and on Sundays but I've not heard much church bells ringing in the States and thought it'd be neat to have them ringing again as Christian's "Call to Prayers."</blockquote>
      </figure>
      <p class="m0">The foundation was formed in February 2026 and approved as a 501(c)(3) in Florida. It exists to pay for the repair — bells and their towers, pipe organs, rose windows and stained glass, and the artisans who know how to mend them.</p>
      <p class="m0">This page is a placeholder for the fuller story, which will be written from the founder's own notes and interviews.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="figure">
      <div class="figure__frame">
        <img src="{{ '/uploads/ringing-chamber.jpg' | url }}" alt="Bell ropes with striped sallies hanging in a ring inside a stone ringing chamber, a narrow arched window beyond and the bell wheels showing above the wooden ceiling" width="1600" height="2000" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <figcaption><span class="figure__caption">The room under the bells.</span></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--band">
  <div class="wrap grid grid--2">
    <div class="card card--lg card--interactive">
      <h3 class="card__title card__title--top">Our founder stays out of the frame</h3>
      <p class="muted m0">She would rather the bells were the story. There are no bios here, no photographs of her, and no names on the grants we give.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card card--lg card--accent card--accent-rose card--interactive">
      <h3 class="card__title card__title--top">For her mother</h3>
      <p class="muted mb-4">The work is dedicated to the founder's mother, and carries her song wherever it goes.</p>
      <em class="dedication">Ave Maria</em>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

